The event table will be used to store all the events created by the organisers. 
It uses the userId as a foreign key to link to the organiser who created the event to manage role-based access control.
The event type uses a check constrain to restrict values to ‘Run’, ‘Walk’, or ‘Cycle’, the DistanceKm uses decimals
to store precise distances and banner image URL stores the azure blob storage URL for event banners.
The relationship between the user and events is that each user can create many events in this case
the organiser can create many events.
